WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.099 --> 00:00:06.066
Fletchling!

2
00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:09.433
Fletchling! Wake up Serena for me, won't you?

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.399
Of course I already tried once, but, as usual, once is never enough! Hm!

4
00:00:14.466 --> 00:00:15.833
Ling, Ling!

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.733
Ling!

6
00:00:22.366 --> 00:00:26.233
Fletch, Fletch, Fletchling!

7
00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:35.766
Fletch!

8
00:00:38.466 --> 00:00:40.500
Good! Looks like we're all ready!

9
00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:44.366
- Fletch, Fletch, Ling, Ling!
- Oh!

10
00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:47.233
I've told you a million times not to wake me up like that!

11
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.566
Fletchy!

12
00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:52.366
- Huh? Ah!
- Ling!

13
00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:55.333
Serena! Time for morning training!

14
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.733
Right!

15
00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.000
Not again.

16
00:01:03.099 --> 00:01:06.566
- Morning, Rhyhorn!
- Rhy!

17
00:01:07.966 --> 00:01:11.633
- Mm! Ah!
- Fletch!

18
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.566
- Hope today's interesting.
- Fletchy Ling!

19
00:01:18.566 --> 00:01:22.366
The Kalos region, like the other regions, a beautiful place

20
00:01:22.433 --> 00:01:25.033
where people and Pokémon live in harmony,

21
00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.566
reflecting each other's thoughts and feelings!

22
00:01:27.633 --> 00:01:30.100
When people smile, Pokémon smile,

23
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:34.333
and when Pokémon cry, you'll find that people cry as well.

24
00:01:34.399 --> 00:01:38.233
And here, a certain young man is about to arrive,

25
00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.600
a young man seeking new dreams and new adventures!

26
00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:45.500
- Pika, Pika!
- Yeah, we'll be on the ground soon!

27
00:01:45.566 --> 00:01:48.399
Ash, you and Pikachu must be really excited!

28
00:01:48.466 --> 00:01:50.433
We're starting a brand new adventure!

29
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.366
There's nothing more exciting to a Pokémon Trainer!

30
00:01:53.433 --> 00:01:54.933
Pikachu!

31
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.000
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

32
00:01:58.066 --> 00:02:01.699
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

33
00:02:01.766 --> 00:02:04.300
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

34
00:02:04.366 --> 00:02:07.300
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

35
00:02:07.366 --> 00:02:10.466
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

36
00:02:10.533 --> 00:02:13.466
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

37
00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:17.000
♪ Pokémon, yeah! You're my best friend ♪

38
00:02:17.066 --> 00:02:19.700
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

39
00:02:19.766 --> 00:02:21.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

40
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

41
00:02:44.566 --> 00:02:47.400
- Pika! Pika, Pika!
- Ahem.

42
00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:53.400
Hey, Kalos region! Ash from Pallet Town is finally here!

43
00:02:53.466 --> 00:02:55.633
Pika!

44
00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:59.066
- What's with all the yelling?
- Just saying hiya to the Kalos region!

45
00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:03.166
And as soon as I walk down these steps, we'll finally be here!

46
00:03:03.233 --> 00:03:04.633
- Pika!
- Huh?

47
00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.166
Never seen those Pokémon before!

48
00:03:09.233 --> 00:03:13.500
Oh? Huh! Huh! Ah!

49
00:03:13.566 --> 00:03:15.866
Huh?

50
00:03:15.933 --> 00:03:17.600
- Pikachu!
- Are you all right?

51
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:19.666
Pikapi!

52
00:03:19.733 --> 00:03:22.566
Yeah, I'm okay.

53
00:03:22.633 --> 00:03:25.066
- Alexa, who are those Pokémon?
- Huh?

54
00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:29.433
- Oh, those are Spritzee!
- Spritzee. Awesome!

55
00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.700
- A typical Twerp entrance...

56
00:03:36.766 --> 00:03:39.066
And with Pikachu, too.

57
00:03:39.133 --> 00:03:41.799
Then it's all in place. Let's get to work!

58
00:03:41.866 --> 00:03:43.866
Wobbuffet!

59
00:03:43.933 --> 00:03:46.700
First thing I want to do is have a Gym battle!

60
00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:48.566
- Just a minute!
- Huh?

61
00:03:48.633 --> 00:03:51.600
So where do you plan to go for a Gym battle?

62
00:03:51.666 --> 00:03:53.533
Oh, that's an easy one!

63
00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.200
Your younger sister's a Gym Leader, right? At her Gym!

64
00:03:57.266 --> 00:04:02.700
Wait. I'm sorry to disappoint you but her Gym isn't here in Lumiose City.

65
00:04:02.766 --> 00:04:05.366
I'm afraid it's located in Santalune City.

66
00:04:05.433 --> 00:04:08.533
- What?! What do I do now?
- Pika!

67
00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.533
Hold on! I'll go and give her a call right away.

68
00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.433
- I'll see you in the lobby!
- Thanks!

69
00:04:21.133 --> 00:04:22.533
Pika, Pika?

70
00:04:22.599 --> 00:04:25.900
I want to see if there are any other Pokémon around!

71
00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:29.900
Huh?

72
00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.800
Pika?

73
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:43.666
Oh.

74
00:04:43.733 --> 00:04:46.599
- Hey, Pikachu. See that?
- Pika!

75
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:48.266
- Oh, yeah!
- Yeah!

76
00:04:48.333 --> 00:04:51.266
Huh?

77
00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:54.733
Helioptile, we just saw the coolest thing!

78
00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:57.900
Where did Alexa go?

79
00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:03.300
- Alexa!
- Huh?

80
00:05:03.366 --> 00:05:05.300
What's with all the excitement?

81
00:05:05.366 --> 00:05:09.266
We just got a look at another new Pokémon! It was so amazing!

82
00:05:09.333 --> 00:05:12.266
It made this jump and flew right over our heads!

83
00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:16.733
I see! I guarantee you're going to meet lots and lots of new Pokémon!

84
00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:20.133
So cool! I'm glad we're finally in the Kalos region!

85
00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.666
I can't wait to win that Gym battle, too!

86
00:05:22.733 --> 00:05:27.433
Uh, you see, I managed to get through to that sister of mine

87
00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:30.133
and she let me know she's away from her Gym right now.

88
00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.533
She's away!? So when is she going to be back?

89
00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:38.166
Once my sister goes on a trip, she's usually away for quite a while.

90
00:05:38.233 --> 00:05:40.466
- Oh, man!
- Pika!

91
00:05:40.533 --> 00:05:45.633
Oh. Sorry, Ash! I know you must be disappointed after coming all this way!

92
00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:51.066
Aw, no way! This is bad! I want to win the league this time!

93
00:05:51.133 --> 00:05:54.666
- And I want to become a Pokémon Master!
- Pika, Pika!

94
00:05:55.666 --> 00:05:58.200
I know! Why don't you channel that energy

95
00:05:58.266 --> 00:06:01.133
into challenging the Gym here, in Lumiose City?

96
00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.800
- Pika?
- So there's a Gym in this city, too?

97
00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.966
See? It's right there.

98
00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:10.166
The Lumiose Gym is located inside of Prism Tower!

99
00:06:10.233 --> 00:06:14.933
Prism Tower, got it. We'll just have our first battle here, in Lumiose City!

100
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.133
I'm afraid this is where we'll have to part ways.

101
00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:21.200
- Are you going to be all right?
- Yeah, we'll be just fine!

102
00:06:21.266 --> 00:06:22.766
- Pika!
- That's great.

103
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:26.200
Well, then, once again, welcome to the Kalos region!

104
00:06:26.266 --> 00:06:29.166
You've really been a big help. Thanks a lot!

105
00:06:29.233 --> 00:06:31.666
No, thank you! It's been great fun!

106
00:06:31.733 --> 00:06:33.733
Yeah.

107
00:06:33.799 --> 00:06:35.866
It sure has.

108
00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:41.566
- See you later, Alexa!
- Right. See you!

109
00:06:41.633 --> 00:06:44.066
All right! Pikachu, let's go!

110
00:06:44.133 --> 00:06:47.266
So much energy...

111
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:49.866
Go get 'em, Ash!

112
00:06:52.599 --> 00:06:54.933
Yeah!

113
00:06:57.599 --> 00:07:00.599
Check it out! Another new Pokémon!

114
00:07:00.666 --> 00:07:06.400
- Oh, wow, Pikachu, this city's gigantic!
- Pika Pika!

115
00:07:07.666 --> 00:07:11.366
Huh? Look at all the new Pokémon!

116
00:07:11.433 --> 00:07:14.566
Whoa! Never seen that before either!

117
00:07:14.633 --> 00:07:17.866
Look, Pikachu, Ampharos! Wow!

118
00:07:17.933 --> 00:07:21.099
And Medicham! There are Pokémon we know.

119
00:07:21.166 --> 00:07:24.400
- Pikachu!
- Huh?

120
00:07:24.466 --> 00:07:28.033
Wow, Pikachu! That's Prism Tower, I'm sure of it!

121
00:07:28.099 --> 00:07:30.566
- That's where our first Gym is!
- Pika!

122
00:07:32.866 --> 00:07:35.933
Yes! This is it, the Lumiose Gym!

123
00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.033
Pika?

124
00:07:38.099 --> 00:07:41.400
Our new challenge is just beginning, right, Pikachu?!

125
00:07:41.466 --> 00:07:44.466
Pika Pikachu!

126
00:07:44.533 --> 00:07:47.200
- So, let's move!
- Pika!

127
00:07:50.833 --> 00:07:53.299
Boy, oh, boy! I'm so psyched!

128
00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:56.799
Anybody here?

129
00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.366
Welcome to the Lumiose Gym!

130
00:08:00.433 --> 00:08:04.733
My name's Ash and I've come all the way from Pallet Town in the Kanto region.

131
00:08:04.799 --> 00:08:07.333
I want to have a Gym battle, please!

132
00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:10.166
- How many badges do you have?
- Badges?

133
00:08:10.233 --> 00:08:13.833
This is the very first Gym I'm challenging here. I haven't won any yet!

134
00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:17.099
You have none?! Not a single Gym badge?!

135
00:08:17.166 --> 00:08:19.500
In order to challenge the Lumiose Gym,

136
00:08:19.566 --> 00:08:22.633
you must have accumulated at least four Gym badges.

137
00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.033
- Oh! Hey, give me a break.
- Please leave immediately.

138
00:08:25.099 --> 00:08:28.799
Wait a minute!

139
00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.266
Whoa!

140
00:08:37.066 --> 00:08:39.866
- Whoa!
- Huh? Oh, no, no !

141
00:08:39.933 --> 00:08:43.299
- I'm going to try to catch that boy!
- I'll get Pikachu!

142
00:08:44.566 --> 00:08:47.500
All right, let's go!

143
00:08:48.733 --> 00:08:50.066
Whoa! Whoa!

144
00:08:50.133 --> 00:08:53.666
I've got you Pikachu! Oh!

145
00:08:53.733 --> 00:08:55.400
Oh! Whoa!

146
00:08:55.466 --> 00:09:01.066
- Are you all right?
- Yeah. I'm okay. Thanks to you!

147
00:09:01.133 --> 00:09:05.233
Take a look at this, Clemont! A Pikachu! And what a cutie!

148
00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:06.966
Pika!

149
00:09:12.199 --> 00:09:14.766
- Bonnie, no!
- Are you okay?

150
00:09:16.566 --> 00:09:19.833
Of course!

151
00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:23.199
- Pika Pika!
- I'm really sorry about my sister.

152
00:09:23.266 --> 00:09:24.933
Hey, don't worry about it!

153
00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.033
Bonnie! You apologize, too!

154
00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:30.633
I just wanted to give Pikachu a hug ‘cause it's so cute!

155
00:09:30.699 --> 00:09:34.466
Hm. But did Pikachu like it?

156
00:09:34.533 --> 00:09:37.533
Hm? Hm...

157
00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.133
All right, I'm really sorry, Pikachu.

158
00:09:40.199 --> 00:09:44.400
Everything's okay now. Pikachu was just a little surprised.

159
00:09:44.466 --> 00:09:47.600
- Pika Pika!
- But I still haven't thanked you yet.

160
00:09:47.666 --> 00:09:50.666
I really appreciate that you saved Pikachu!

161
00:09:50.733 --> 00:09:52.400
- Pika Pika!
- Huh?

162
00:09:52.466 --> 00:09:54.433
You're very welcome!

163
00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:58.166
What a weird Gym. What's up with that?

164
00:09:58.233 --> 00:10:00.133
You got kicked out, right?

165
00:10:00.199 --> 00:10:04.066
Right! And after coming all this way. Some Gym Leader...

166
00:10:04.133 --> 00:10:06.433
Yeah, he's something, all right.

167
00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:11.333
The Gym Leader of the Lumiose Gym is this really super-duper strong person!

168
00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.566
So, they asked you how many badges you have, right?

169
00:10:13.633 --> 00:10:18.033
That's right! But when I told them I didn't have any, I got zapped bad!

170
00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:20.100
- Huh?
- Huh? You don't have any badges?

171
00:10:20.166 --> 00:10:22.866
You see, I just arrived in the Kalos region.

172
00:10:22.933 --> 00:10:27.300
- This is the first Gym I've been to!
- Pardon me, but where are you from?

173
00:10:27.366 --> 00:10:30.699
I'm from Pallet Town in Kanto and my name is Ash!

174
00:10:30.766 --> 00:10:34.133
This is Pikachu and my buddy and I are on a journey together

175
00:10:34.199 --> 00:10:38.000
so I can become a Pokémon Master! -Pika Pikachu!

176
00:10:38.066 --> 00:10:40.566
Who's that Pokémon?

177
00:10:45.066 --> 00:10:46.633
It's Spritzee!

178
00:10:46.699 --> 00:10:48.600
Spritzee!

179
00:10:51.733 --> 00:10:54.333
And now it's time for us to introduce ourselves!

180
00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.766
My name's Clemont, and this is my little sister, Bonnie.

181
00:10:57.833 --> 00:11:01.233
- Nice to meet you!
- Nice to meet you, Clemont. Bonnie.

182
00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.400
Pika, Pika!

183
00:11:02.466 --> 00:11:05.266
You and your Pikachu look like such good friends.

184
00:11:05.333 --> 00:11:09.433
If you weren't, Pikachu wouldn't be sitting on your head like that!

185
00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:12.833
Yeah! We've known each other for a long time.

186
00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.300
Pikachu!

187
00:11:14.366 --> 00:11:17.733
Actually, Pikachu was the first Pokémon I ever got!

188
00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.600
We're continuing our journey

189
00:11:19.666 --> 00:11:22.266
and looking for Gym battles! -Pika!

190
00:11:22.333 --> 00:11:25.166
So are you and Bonnie on a journey too?

191
00:11:25.233 --> 00:11:26.900
- Journey?! Well, you see...
- Oh.

192
00:11:26.966 --> 00:11:29.666
That's something we'll be doing some time in the future!

193
00:11:29.733 --> 00:11:31.833
A family adventure sounds great!

194
00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.766
After all, I don't have any brothers or sisters.

195
00:11:34.833 --> 00:11:37.666
But you've got your special friend Pikachu instead!

196
00:11:37.733 --> 00:11:41.333
Bonnie's a little bit too young to have any Pokémon yet,

197
00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.166
so she's really impressed when she meets someone who does!

198
00:11:44.233 --> 00:11:45.866
I know just what it's like!

199
00:11:45.933 --> 00:11:48.900
I could hardly wait to grow up and become a Pokémon Trainer!

200
00:11:48.966 --> 00:11:51.500
You totally understand how I feel!

201
00:11:51.566 --> 00:11:54.500
So, what kind of Pokémon do you have, Clemont?

202
00:11:54.566 --> 00:11:56.333
- Huh?
- Hm...

203
00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:59.733
Okay, here's a Pokémon that I recently caught.

204
00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:02.766
Oh, please, can I see it? Then, let's battle!

205
00:12:02.833 --> 00:12:05.133
Pika! Pi, Pi, Pi, Pi, Pi!

206
00:12:05.199 --> 00:12:09.033
- Battle for real?
- Yeah! If I can't have a Gym battle,

207
00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:12.133
I'd like to have my first battle in the Kalos region with you!

208
00:12:12.199 --> 00:12:13.800
What do you say, Clemont?!

209
00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:17.233
Let's do it! It'll be a great test of strength!

210
00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:19.300
Okay. You're on!

211
00:12:22.166 --> 00:12:26.566
All right, Bunnelby, come on out and let's have a battle!

212
00:12:26.633 --> 00:12:27.666
Bunnelby!

213
00:12:27.733 --> 00:12:30.400
Awesome! I've never seen that Pokémon before!

214
00:12:30.466 --> 00:12:33.600
- Pika Pika!
- Pikachu, let's give it our all!

215
00:12:33.666 --> 00:12:36.566
- Pikachu!
- Hm...

216
00:12:36.633 --> 00:12:40.599
Lots of luck to both teams! Yay!

217
00:12:43.699 --> 00:12:47.033
Now, Bunnelby, this will be our very first battle!

218
00:12:47.099 --> 00:12:50.000
Just relax and you'll do great!

219
00:12:50.066 --> 00:12:53.066
- Okay, Pikachu! Use Thunderbolt!
- Pika!

220
00:12:53.133 --> 00:12:57.300
Pika... Chu!

221
00:12:57.366 --> 00:13:00.166
Now, Bunnelby, use your ears to stir up the sand!

222
00:13:00.233 --> 00:13:01.866
Bunnelby!

223
00:13:05.333 --> 00:13:08.466
- Huh?
- Yes, Bunnelby is a Normal-type Pokémon,

224
00:13:08.533 --> 00:13:12.233
but it's more than prepared to deal with any Electric-type moves!

225
00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:15.733
- Whoa! Bunnelby's really strong!
- Pika!

226
00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.966
So now it's our turn. Bunnelby! Dig!

227
00:13:18.033 --> 00:13:21.166
Bunnel-brrree!

228
00:13:21.233 --> 00:13:24.366
Take off, Pikachu! Don't let them know where you are!

229
00:13:25.766 --> 00:13:29.599
Trying to use speed to confuse us, eh? Well, it won't work!

230
00:13:29.666 --> 00:13:30.666
Pika!

231
00:13:30.733 --> 00:13:33.699
- Now, go!
- Pikachu!

232
00:13:33.766 --> 00:13:37.066
Bunnelby!

233
00:13:37.133 --> 00:13:39.599
No! You okay, Pikachu?

234
00:13:39.666 --> 00:13:42.366
Pika! Pika!

235
00:13:42.433 --> 00:13:44.833
Yeah! Okay, that's the spirit!

236
00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:48.066
All right, Pikachu, use Quick Attack!

237
00:13:48.133 --> 00:13:51.066
- Pik! Pik! Pik! Pikachu!
- Huh?

238
00:13:56.366 --> 00:13:58.733
Double Slap, let's go!

239
00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:01.233
Pika?

240
00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.533
Look at Bunnelby's ears! They're just like hands!

241
00:14:04.599 --> 00:14:05.866
Bee!

242
00:14:05.933 --> 00:14:09.599
Pretty neat, huh? Bunnelby's ears can do lots of great things!

243
00:14:10.933 --> 00:14:12.099
Pika!

244
00:14:12.166 --> 00:14:15.300
- You're still fine, aren't you, buddy?!
- Pika! Pika!

245
00:14:15.366 --> 00:14:18.566
- Awesome! Now use Iron Tail!
- Pika... Chu!

246
00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.099
Look at that! Pikachu knows a Steel-type move!

247
00:14:23.166 --> 00:14:24.633
Use your ears and catch it!

248
00:14:24.699 --> 00:14:25.933
Pika!

249
00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.699
- Bun!
- Pika!

250
00:14:28.766 --> 00:14:31.233
-It worked like it should!

251
00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:36.166
Yeah, it was good that you caught it, but now it's too bad you can't use your ears!

252
00:14:36.233 --> 00:14:37.500
Huh?

253
00:14:37.566 --> 00:14:42.000
You're strong all right, but you can't move anymore. Electro Ball!

254
00:14:42.066 --> 00:14:45.099
Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika! Ah!

255
00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.199
Oh! Oh, wow!

256
00:14:52.266 --> 00:14:55.400
- Ash and Pikachu are pretty amazing!
- Mm.

257
00:14:55.466 --> 00:14:58.833
By battling him, I understand him even better.

258
00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:01.699
- Use Quick Attack!
- Pika! Pik! Pik!

259
00:15:01.766 --> 00:15:03.733
Heads up, Bunnelby!

260
00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.633
Pik! Pik! Pik!

261
00:15:05.699 --> 00:15:07.166
Pika!

262
00:15:07.233 --> 00:15:08.766
Pika!

263
00:15:08.833 --> 00:15:10.566
Huh?

264
00:15:10.633 --> 00:15:13.066
- Are you okay, Pikachu!?
- Pikachu!

265
00:15:13.133 --> 00:15:16.166
All right! What do you think you're doing?

266
00:15:16.233 --> 00:15:18.533
- That was dangerous!
- Who are you?

267
00:15:18.599 --> 00:15:21.199
Prepare for trouble, our middle name!

268
00:15:21.266 --> 00:15:23.466
And make it double, it's a high-stakes game!

269
00:15:23.533 --> 00:15:25.966
To protect the world from devastation!

270
00:15:26.033 --> 00:15:28.766
To unite all people within our nation!

271
00:15:28.833 --> 00:15:31.866
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

272
00:15:31.933 --> 00:15:35.066
To extend our reach to the stars above!

273
00:15:35.133 --> 00:15:37.599
- Jessie!
- And James!

274
00:15:37.666 --> 00:15:40.566
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

275
00:15:40.633 --> 00:15:43.633
Surrender now or prepare to fight, fight and fight!

276
00:15:43.699 --> 00:15:46.633
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

277
00:15:48.099 --> 00:15:52.099
- Team Rocket! You would follow us here!
- Wait, do you know them?

278
00:15:52.166 --> 00:15:55.633
I've never seen a talking Meowth before! That's incredible! Huh?

279
00:15:55.699 --> 00:16:00.199
Wait! Those are a group of really bad guys who are always trying to take my Pikachu!

280
00:16:00.266 --> 00:16:02.966
Excuse me, Twerp, but you're selling us short!

281
00:16:03.033 --> 00:16:06.566
Catching Pikachu is but one of our numerous, yet glorious goals!

282
00:16:06.633 --> 00:16:08.800
The rest of them include the confiscation

283
00:16:08.866 --> 00:16:11.333
of all the strong and rare Pokémon in Kalos!

284
00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.300
Forming a formidable Pokémon army is inevitable!

285
00:16:14.366 --> 00:16:17.599
- But catching Pikachu is job one!
- Pikachu!

286
00:16:17.666 --> 00:16:21.199
There's no better way for us to begin our Kalos kingdom!

287
00:16:21.266 --> 00:16:24.366
- Wobbuffet!
- And I'll take the one with the ears!

288
00:16:24.433 --> 00:16:26.500
- Huh?
- Pika! Pika!

289
00:16:26.566 --> 00:16:28.366
Like that's going to happen!

290
00:16:28.433 --> 00:16:32.533
I will not sit idly by and let you steal other people's Pokémon!

291
00:16:32.599 --> 00:16:35.233
That's right! Who do you think you are, anyway?

292
00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.300
Team Rocket, that's who!

293
00:16:37.366 --> 00:16:40.033
All right, Pikachu! Use Thunderbolt!

294
00:16:40.099 --> 00:16:42.433
Pi! Pikachu!

295
00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.300
Wobbuffet, time to shine!

296
00:16:44.366 --> 00:16:46.966
Wobbuffet!

297
00:16:47.033 --> 00:16:48.400
-Hey, that's Mirror Coat!

298
00:16:48.466 --> 00:16:50.900
Pikachu! Pika!

299
00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:55.900
Pikachu!

300
00:16:55.966 --> 00:16:58.900
- Hey, buddy! Are you okay?
- Pika!

301
00:16:58.966 --> 00:17:01.000
Poor Pikachu!

302
00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.000
Excellent. I give you an 11!

303
00:17:04.066 --> 00:17:05.466
Wobba!

304
00:17:05.533 --> 00:17:07.166
- Oh!
- We'd better retreat!

305
00:17:07.233 --> 00:17:10.966
Using Mirror Coat reflects special attacks with double the power!

306
00:17:11.033 --> 00:17:13.533
We can't withstand that kind of strength.

307
00:17:13.599 --> 00:17:18.466
We've always stood up to them before and we always will!

308
00:17:18.533 --> 00:17:22.966
As long as Pikachu is okay, as long as Pikachu doesn't give up,

309
00:17:23.033 --> 00:17:26.466
- I'll be right here, battling to the end!
- Pikachu!

310
00:17:28.033 --> 00:17:30.466
Huh? Hm...

311
00:17:30.533 --> 00:17:32.533
All you'll end up with are reruns!

312
00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.899
Now, Pikachu, Electro Ball!

313
00:17:34.966 --> 00:17:37.899
Pik! Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika!

314
00:17:37.966 --> 00:17:41.433
We'll help you out, too! Bunnelby, use Mud Shot!

315
00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:49.733
- You're on, Wobbuffet!
- Wob! Buff! Buff! Buff!

316
00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:51.100
It dodged them all!

317
00:17:51.166 --> 00:17:53.866
Wobbuff!

318
00:17:53.933 --> 00:17:55.100
- Uh-oh!
- Oh!

319
00:17:55.166 --> 00:17:58.233
- Pikachu!
- Froakie!

320
00:18:01.566 --> 00:18:03.399
- Fro!
- Pikachu!

321
00:18:03.466 --> 00:18:05.733
-Are you okay, Pikachu?

322
00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:07.000
- Pika! Pika!
- Huh?

323
00:18:07.066 --> 00:18:09.000
- What's that?
- A Pokémon?

324
00:18:09.066 --> 00:18:13.333
- Kie... Fro!
- It's a Froakie!

325
00:18:13.399 --> 00:18:14.666
Froakie?

326
00:18:14.733 --> 00:18:17.566
It's a water-type Pokémon new Trainers can get in Kalos!

327
00:18:17.633 --> 00:18:20.166
So that Electro Ball must have done lots of damage!

328
00:18:20.233 --> 00:18:21.933
Are you okay, Froakie?

329
00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.300
- So where is its Trainer?
- Huh?

330
00:18:24.366 --> 00:18:27.533
- Froak! Froak! Froak!
- Where's Froakie going?

331
00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:28.700
Froakie Froak!

332
00:18:28.766 --> 00:18:31.200
What's with the yapping?

333
00:18:31.266 --> 00:18:33.700
I think that Froakie wants to help us.

334
00:18:33.766 --> 00:18:35.700
Fro!

335
00:18:35.766 --> 00:18:38.633
Froakie's saying bad guys rub it the wrong way!

336
00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:41.666
You can't take them on if you've been hurt! Stop!

337
00:18:41.733 --> 00:18:43.766
- Froak!
- Ugh! Froakie!

338
00:18:43.833 --> 00:18:46.133
Froakie!

339
00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.899
Wow, Froakie just used its Frubbles!

340
00:18:47.966 --> 00:18:50.966
Big whoop! We'll just send that right back at you!

341
00:18:51.033 --> 00:18:57.366
Wobbuffet! Wob! Whoa, whoa, whoa! Whoa! Wob.

342
00:18:57.433 --> 00:19:00.433
- What's this?
- I can't get this gunk off!

343
00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.366
How come it didn't bounce back?

344
00:19:02.433 --> 00:19:05.433
Of course! Froakie's gummy Frubbles isn't a move,

345
00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:08.433
so Wobbuffet's Mirror Coat was completely ineffective!

346
00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.733
- Awesome, Froakie, way to go!
- Fro!

347
00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.166
- Pikachu and I can take it from here!
- Pika!

348
00:19:13.233 --> 00:19:16.066
- We'll lend a hand, too!
- Bunnelby!

349
00:19:16.133 --> 00:19:18.666
You guys better not forget about me!

350
00:19:18.733 --> 00:19:22.366
- Now, Bunnelby, use Dig!
- Bunnel-brree!

351
00:19:24.033 --> 00:19:28.000
Oy vey!

352
00:19:28.066 --> 00:19:30.500
- Yeah! Way to go!
- Nice work, Bunnelby!

353
00:19:32.566 --> 00:19:35.633
Let's wrap this up! Pikachu, Thunderbolt, go!

354
00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:38.933
- Pi! Pikachu!
- Froakie!

355
00:19:42.466 --> 00:19:46.333
- We're blasting off again!
- Wobbuffet!

356
00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:50.166
Wow! Awesome power!

357
00:19:50.233 --> 00:19:53.600
- Thanks, everybody!
- Bunnelby, you were just great!

358
00:19:53.666 --> 00:19:56.633
-Huh?

359
00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:59.500
Froakie! Something's wrong!

360
00:19:59.566 --> 00:20:00.766
Ah... Froakie!

361
00:20:00.833 --> 00:20:04.100
- Froakie needs help right away.
- Is there a Pokémon Center?

362
00:20:04.166 --> 00:20:08.200
- Well, from here, I'm trying to think...
- I think it would be whole a lot quicker

363
00:20:08.266 --> 00:20:11.300
if we brought Froakie to the Professor's lab instead!

364
00:20:11.366 --> 00:20:15.466
- The Professor?
- Yeah, Professor Sycamore's research lab!

365
00:20:15.533 --> 00:20:17.800
There's no doubt he'll know how to help Froakie!

366
00:20:17.866 --> 00:20:20.800
All right, Bunnelby, return!

367
00:20:20.866 --> 00:20:23.700
Thanks a lot! You really helped out!

368
00:20:23.766 --> 00:20:25.533
-Hm!

369
00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:29.033
- Come on Ash, this way!
- I'm coming, Bonnie!

370
00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.333
Just hang in there, Froakie!

371
00:20:33.399 --> 00:20:36.233
You're going to be feeling all better really soon!

372
00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:39.633
A new region! New Pokémon! New friends!

373
00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:44.399
And this is only the beginning of Ash and Pikachu's exciting new adventures,

374
00:20:44.466 --> 00:20:47.000
as the journey continues!
